  "description": "<p>Uniquely crafted, handmade products &amp; accessories for the stylish pup who loves to walk, shop &amp; brunch!</p>\r\n<p>Bop Pop is a family that rescues &amp; fosters. I wanted to create a brand that highlights their spirit &amp; unconditional love. The inspiration for creating a pet product line is my love for Rufus, our first rescue pup.</p>\r\n<p>All our products are handmade and designed in Oregon with a bohemian aesthetic. When designing, we consider all materials that have a recycle/reuse feature, yet create products that include you &amp; your pets together! Since my belief is to take your pets everywhere, we initially designed the Patio Bowls in 2020 as our first product, but now we're excited to include more products which complete the pet lifestyle both you &amp; your pups deserve!....Happy pups, happy humans!</p>\r\n<p><em><strong>\"Walk Together, Stay Together!\"</strong></em></p>",
